  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((542+321)²-(542-321)²)/(542 × 321)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b)² = a² + b² + 2ab\n\n(a - b)2 = a2 + b2 - 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n((542+321)²-(542-321)²)/(542 × 321)\n\n⇒ ((542)² + (321)² + 2×542 × 321 - (542)² - (321)² + 2×542 × 321)/(542 × 321)\n\n⇒ (4 × 542 × 321)/542 × 321\n\n⇒ 4\n\n**∴ Required answer is 4**\n\n171:T",
